					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Joyce"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 411110601,
					"content": "Dear mortals, in this dark hour, your Prinzessin permits you to forgo the usual etiquette and simply relay your account of the matter at hand forthrightly.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411110602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fischl"
				},
				{
					"id": 411110602,
					"content": "...Excuse me? Who are you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411110603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Joyce"
				},
				{
					"id": 411110603,
					"content": "We come in peace, good sir. We were just hoping that you could reveal whatever you know about this poor victim's situation.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411110604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Oz"
				},
				{
					"id": 411110604,
					"content": "Wait, wait! Stop, let Paimon explain... We're from the Adventurers' Guild. They commissioned us to come here and investigate after the meteor shower.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411110605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411110605,
					"content": "Oh, I see. Well, last night, this fellow touched the meteorite, and then he fainted just moments later.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411110606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Joyce"
				},
				{
					"id": 411110606,
					"content": "So, however you plan to conduct your investigation, I implore you: Do not, under any circumstances, touch the meteorites with your bare hands.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411110607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Joyce"
				},
				{
					"id": 411110607,
					"content": "What ridiculous remonstration is this? Is one not under the divine protection of one's Edelstein der Dunkelheit, and thus impervious to the trifling threat posed by this petty piece of black crystal?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411110608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fischl"
				},
				{
					"id": 411110608,
					"content": "On the contrary, mein Fräulein, wise is the princess who is receptive to the sound advice offered by her subjects.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411110609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Oz"
				},
				{
					"id": 411110609,
					"content": "Is that so... Very well then, one shall proceed as advised.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411110610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fischl"
				},
				{
					"id": 411110610,
					"content": "#That goes for you, too, {NICKNAME}! Wise is the adventurer who is receptive to the sound advice offered by smart people!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411110611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411110611,
					"content": "Yes, Paimon...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411110612
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411110612,
					"content": "Ehehehe, Paimon never gets to talk like that! Oh, Paimon could get used to it, though...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411110613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411110613,
					"content": "You dare to parrot the parlance of the Prinzessin!? Hmph! What could one hope to comprehend of the lamenting of a thousand dying worlds with the sagacity of a mere mortal?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411110614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fischl"
				},
				{
					"id": 411110614,
					"content": "Perhaps it is better that you remain in blissful ignorance, for the burden of fate borne by the Prinzessin der Verurteilung would surely be too much for thy shoulders.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411110615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fischl"
				},
				{
					"id": 411110615,
					"content": "Please lead the way, O fair Princess.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4111114,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4111114
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"4111114",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 4111114,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Edna"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 411111401,
					"content": "Edna! We got rid of the meteorite up on the hill behind the village. How are the victims doing now? Any better?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111402,
					"content": "Bless you! Thanks to your efforts, two of the victims have already awoken.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Edna"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111403,
					"content": "Ugh... I'm so sleepy... *yawn*",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Hartman"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111404,
					"content": "Great, so it did work!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111405,
					"content": "I do hope you are able to dispose of the rest of the <color=#00E1FFFF>meteorites</color> around the village...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Edna"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111406,
					"content": "Then everyone else will wake up, too!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111407
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411111407,
					"content": "This is wonderful news, it gladdens the heart.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Oz"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111408,
					"content": "Haha, it is most gladdening, indeed. Yet the news that I would be attending to this matter in person was surely the only guarantee that my faithful subjects ever needed of a felicitous outcome!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fischl"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111409,
					"content": "Hey, you just woke up, right? What were you dreaming about while you were asleep?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111410,
					"content": "All I remember is that it was cold... I was walking along a <color=#00E1FFFF>mountain</color> path... In the ice and snow, I think...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Hartman"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111411,
					"content": "So... Just hiking in the mountains? Or were you supposed to have a destination?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111412,
					"content": "Ah, I really don't know... In my dream, it felt like... I wasn't in full control of my actions.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Hartman"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111413,
					"content": "Then thou wert surely cursed, I say! O, wretched scourge upon this land...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fischl"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111414,
					"content": "(A curse? Could it really be?)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111415
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411111415,
					"content": "Well, whatever the case, what we do know is that getting rid of the meteorite shards is helping. So, c'mon guys, we need to redouble our efforts!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4111115,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4111115
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"4111115",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 4111115,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Adler"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 411111501,
					"content": "Look, another victim!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111502,
					"content": "Pray tell, O Knight, what tragedy befell this unfortunate subject of mine?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fischl"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111503,
					"content": "Um... He— He's been sleeping all day and shows no signs of waking up.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111504,
						411111506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Adler"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111504,
					"content": "Did he touch the meteorite?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111505
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411111505,
					"content": "He did. And now he's fast asleep, occasionally he also sleep-talks.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Adler"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111508,
					"content": "Can't go on... n—need to rest...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Adler"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111509,
					"content": "Wh—What's going on? Why is he saying that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111510,
					"content": "His dark dream harbors a forbidden fruit, poised between the jaws of a ferocious beast... Woe betide the weak should they peer into its eyes, as black as a moonless midnight, for they shall surely be lured into the abyss...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fischl"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111511,
					"content": "Do you mean... There's something luring him in his dream?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111512,
					"content": "Though we have no evidence to prove it, mein Fräulein's intuition has never failed her before.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Oz"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111513,
					"content": "Hmm... Well, let's keep investigating anyway!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111506,
					"content": "Are there any other symptoms besides the deep sleep?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111507
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411111507,
					"content": "Not that I've seen so far, although occasionally he talks in his sleep.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Adler"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4111116,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4111116
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"4111116",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 4111116,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Edna"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 411111601,
					"content": "Greetings, I am Sister Edna. I am here to nurse the sick.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Edna"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111602,
					"content": "State your name at once, you heinous heathen of nefarious nightmares!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fischl"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111603,
					"content": "My apologies, mein Fräulein was not addressing you... This man lying on the ground — has he spoken at all?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Oz"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111604,
					"content": "I believe he said something about having to get back to work...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Edna"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111605,
					"content": "The wine... The wine...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Hartman"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111606,
					"content": "So he works in the wine business?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111607
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411111607,
					"content": "He seems to be sleeping deeply indeed.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Oz"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111608,
					"content": "This is no ordinary dream... This man... he has been cursed!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fischl"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111609,
					"content": "Can't you just wake him up?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111610,
					"content": "I have tried. He awoke once, for a brief moment, but quickly lapsed back into sleep.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Edna"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111611,
					"content": "Um... Did he tell you anything while he was awake?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111612,
					"content": "He said he dreamed he was on top of a mountain, and it was very cold there.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Edna"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111613,
					"content": "Hmm... Mountain, cold... Hmm...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111614,
					"content": "This has the trappings of a cruel, cold curse by a mountain-dwelling demon... Alas! One fears these demons have descended from their icy peaks and now covet the domain of the spring fairy!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fischl"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111615,
					"content": "This is a most grave state of affairs... But fear not, for damnation is mine to dispense—",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fischl"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111616,
					"content": "Sorry to interrupt you, folks — do you have a moment to spare?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Draff"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111617,
					"content": "Oh, hey, Draff! What's the matter?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111618,
					"content": "It's... I—I can hardly get the words out...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Draff"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111619,
					"content": "One of the <color=#00E1FFFF>meteorites</color> struck the <color=#00E1FFFF>hill behind our village</color>. <color=#00E1FFFF>Allan</color> told everyone he was going to go see it for himself... And then, sure enough, he just ran off.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Draff"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111620,
					"content": "You've seen how dangerous these confounded meteorites are. I'm afraid something may have happened to him... Could you come with me to find him and bring him back?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Draff"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111621,
					"content": "Wait, so... Big blazing rocks fall out of the sky, and all Allan's worried about is missing out on the action!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111622
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111622,
					"content": "Exactly! Once we get that rascal back safely, he's due for the scolding of a lifetime, if you ask me!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Draff"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111623,
					"content": "Paimon could not agree more! Let's go find that rascal and drag him back by the ears!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4111117,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4111117
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"4111117",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 4111117,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Allan"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 411111701,
					"content": "Phew! I thought I was going to die here...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Allan"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111702,
					"content": "You fool! What were you thinking, gallivanting off on your own at a time like this!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Draff"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111703,
					"content": "I—I'm sorry! I'll never do it again!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Allan"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111704,
					"content": "I sincerely apologize for the trouble Allan has caused for you all. I will make absolutely sure that he learns his lesson!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Draff"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111705,
					"content": "Yeah, next time you think about doing something stupid, think again!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111706,
					"content": "The meteorite is just over there.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111707
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411111707,
					"content": "Paimon's gonna go take a closer loo— Huh? Princess, your <color=#00E1FFFF>Vision</color> is <color=#00E1FFFF>flashing</color>!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111708,
					"content": "Oh? Could it be, perchance, that mine Edelstein der Dunkelheit portends the certain demise of this unholy hex of cold?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fischl"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111709,
					"content": "Maybe...? What kind of things does your Vision react to, exactly?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111710,
					"content": "The profoundest of enigmas... the whispered secrets of the stars... unholy hexes of demon bones... and—",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fischl"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111711,
					"content": "Whaaaat? Why do you have to talk so funny all the time, Paimon doesn't understand!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111712,
					"content": "Our apologies, mein Fräulein is not well-versed in the parlance of the common folk.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Oz"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111713,
					"content": "Ooooh, so that's what you're for? To translate?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111714,
					"content": "I fear you misunderstand — I am no translator, but a humble conveyor of mein Fräulein's royal will. I would venture that what her <color=#00E1FFFF>Vision</color> is reacting to in this vicinity is, quite simply, <color=#00E1FFFF>elemental energy</color>.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Oz"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111715,
					"content": "Ahem, thank you, Oz. Those whose minds are muddled by the mundane matters of this woeful world are unable to fathom my noble intent as swiftly as thou art...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111716
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fischl"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111716,
					"content": "So, there's elemental energy in the meteorite? And your Vision flashes in response to it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111717,
						411111718
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111717,
					"content": "With a Vision, can you trace the elemental energy back to its source?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111719
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411111719,
					"content": "Paimon thinks... probably yes? Anyway, no harm in giving it a try! Let's look for <color=#00E1FFFF>shards of meteorite</color> using Fischl's <color=#00E1FFFF>Vision</color> — clearing them away will help make the area less dangerous.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111718,
					"content": "Shouldn't the source of the energy also respond in like fashion?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111719
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4111118,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4111118
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"4111118",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 4111118,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Fischl"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 411111801,
					"content": "That seems to be the last of them. Do you think getting rid of them will help make things better for the Springvale villagers?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111802,
					"content": "The question is, are these shards of meteorite, which are infused with elemental energy, the true source of the calamity, or not?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Oz"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111803,
					"content": "Verily, I say, these meteorites are surely the source of the nefarious nightmares that assail my subjects! This I swear on my very sovereignty.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fischl"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111804,
					"content": "...Shall we check in with the villagers, then?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111805
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411111805,
					"content": "Yeah, let's do that!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}